msgstr "采购明细的产品和公司必须与来源销售明细一致。"

#. module: qing_sale_purchase
#: code:addons/qing_sale_purchase/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
msgid "The arranged quantity exceeds the sales quantity. A purchase manager must enter an over-purchase reason."
msgstr "已安排数量超过销售数量，必须由采购经理填写超量采购原因。"

#. module: qing_sale_purchase
#: code:addons/qing_sale_purchase/models/purchase_order_line.py:0
